    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2102.00547v1</id>
    <title>Maximum Number of Non-Intersecting Diagonals in Square Arrays</title>
    <updated>2021-01-31T21:47:56Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.00547v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2102.00547v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>In this paper, we derive a formula to express the maximum number of non-intersecting diagonals of arbitrary length that can be drawn in n x n square arrays, where n is a multiple of l+1.</summary>
